  "scope": "Limited manual assessment of 22 named, hash-verified images from 68 Babylon captures of the exact diagnostic clips. This is not a full-motion, compound-pose, appearance or production qualification.",
  "observations": [
    "All 68 views completed without browser errors; the recorded Babylon corrective morph influences were checked against the diagnostic clips.",
    "The left shoulder 90-degree paired oblique and side views show no convincing shape improvement at the available scale; the rounded shoulder root remains. Front detail is partly occluded by the raised hand.",
    "The right shoulder remains broadly rounded with a fold at its root; the right shoulder and hips were not the localized repair target. Paired hip views retain abrupt creases.",
    "The 45-degree front pairs and current bind and skeleton views show no obvious gross change, but they are insufficient to qualify animation. Controlled intersection counts remain 31/0 at shoulders and 40/27 at hips, identical to the comparator.",
    "The added patch improves the reported local rigid energy and edge strain without reducing contacts; that numerical result alone does not establish visual quality."
  ],
